WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.860
<v Rotcrown>Rotcrown: So. The Accord sends children to
my court.</v>

2
00:00:04.258 --> 00:00:07.828
<v Rotcrown>Rotcrown: Everything you love will wither.
I can stop that.</v>

3
00:00:08.467 --> 00:00:10.767
<v Clover>Clover: Stopping isn't the same as saving.</v>

4
00:00:11.425 --> 00:00:14.005
<v Rotcrown>Rotcrown: Then kneel... and stay forever.</v>

